window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Note: </b><i>Previously published as Crazy Vulnerable by Jaycee Wolfe. This is a second edition of that title, and has undergone significant edits while the content/plot remains largely the same.</i><br> <br> Halle and Loki are a match made in hell doing their damndest to build their own little slice of heaven together. But life isn't always in our corner, is it?<br> We’ve seen them crazy, them reckless, but it's time to see them vulnerable.</p>"; 
